{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"40a1b63fc07d816ce5a04cc8f4eab5eea4abf637dcad93713f6fd329e0afda2b"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:bdc3c430af7cfe1b4097f9688f76202cae13299a1f1e0bd9170a4efd9e8b5011","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"No, some had issues.","evidence":"[D27:10 | 10:49 am on 29 October, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin, photography has been great for me! The car project is doing well - I just finished restoring it and it looks amazing. Wanna come by and check it out? How's everything with the music? Any updates?\n[D13:7 | 5:22 pm on 11 August, 2023] Dave: I've been working on this car, doing engine swaps and suspension modifications. Now I'm learning about body modifications. Giving this classic muscle car a modern twist is a challenge but so fun!\n[D25:17 | 2:17 pm on 23 October, 2023] Dave: Thanks Calvin! It was a fun project. I restored a car last year, but I sold it to a collector. Now I'm working on something new, and it's quite a challenge! Take a look at this wonderful car!\n[D20:1 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin, good to catch up again! Had a tough time with my car project. Worked on the engine of the vintage Mustang, thought I'd fixed it, but when I started it up, heard a weird noise. So disappointing after putting so much work in. Take a look at the engine!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c4e085d3-4305-52a8-9912-b56c97454ee2","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f22355156139ae95f900a91627ff603d6eb1110175516f98da8bce860e0a6bb4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Do all of Dave's car restoration projects go smoothly?","referenceAnswer":"No","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f22355156139ae95f900a91627ff603d6eb1110175516f98da8bce860e0a6bb4"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}